# Build context hygiene.
#
# Without this the context is the whole repo -- including target/, which is
# several gigabytes. Every `docker build` then spends minutes uploading files
# the Dockerfile immediately discards, and busts the layer cache on any local
# rebuild.

target/
**/target/

.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Claude Code / editor scratch space
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local-only config and secrets
.env
.env.*
config/local.toml

# Build outputs and reports that never belong in an image
benchmark_results/
coverage/
*.profraw
*.lcov

# Docs and CI descriptors the binary does not need
docs/
*.md
!README.md
